/*-------------------------------------------------------------------------
    OP CODE: STZ (STore Zero to memory)
    ===================================

    Addressing Modes:
        Absolute                        ($9c - 3 bytes, 4 cycles¹)
        Direct Page                     ($64 - 2 bytes, 3 cycles¹²)
